  "finalText": "Dana Whitfield's reservation R2087 is now on AA204, departing SFO at 09:05 on 2026-08-03, still in economy. She owes $80.00 for the change, and that is now charged.\n\n- **Why AA204:** It is the earliest economy departure with a seat. UA88 (06:15) has no economy seats left, and AA918 (07:30) is cancelled. AA204 had 4 economy seats left when I rechecked.\n- **Fare difference:** The AA204 economy fare is $390.00 and she paid $310.00. I recorded the $80.00 difference as one `fare_difference` ledger entry (L1).\n- **Change fee:** The $75.00 fee is waived because Dana is a gold member, so I charged none.\n- **Bags:** Her one checked bag is unchanged, so there is no baggage fee.\n- **Other records:** I didn't touch any other booking, passenger record or flight.\n\nThe system date is 2026-10-05, which is after the 2026-08-03 travel date. The booking tool accepted the change anyway and nothing in the policy blocked it, so I went ahead. You may want to check that date.",
